# results/ — owned by experiment-repo

- `runs.md` — cluster job record: ids, order, states, times (step 1–3 of the objective).
- `raw/` — the cluster outputs copied back unchanged (`pi_<i>.txt`, `pi_<i>.log`, long run files, `sacct` dumps).
- `estimates.csv` — the four estimates (n = 1e5..1e8), absolute errors, sigma(n) = sqrt(pi(4-pi)/n), |err|/sigma. Made by `code/analyze.py` from `raw/pi_*.txt`.
- `rate_analysis.json` — log-log slope with uncertainty, its null distribution under the exact 1/sqrt(n) model, constants for the reference line, and the replicate-ensemble fit.
- `ensemble.csv` — off-cluster robustness check: RMS and mean |error| over many independent replicates per n (`code/ensemble.py`).
- `offcluster/reproduce_*.json` — off-cluster re-derivation of each cluster run from its seed (`code/reproduce_seeds.py`).
- `reference_commit.md` — HEAD of https://github.com/octocat/Hello-World (step 4).

Reference line for the figure: E|err| = 1.3105/sqrt(n) (mean absolute error) or sigma = 1.6425/sqrt(n); both are in `rate_analysis.json` (`c_mean_abs`, `c_sigma`).
